# Dashboard navigation for Grokbots

This app is Utah Mountain Luxury Management (`wilhite-portfolio`). Live: https://wilhite-portfolio.pages.dev

When operating the **dashboard in a browser**, do not depend on clicking the rounded nav chips first. They are often covered by chat FABs or overlays.

**Preferred:**

1. Open `https://wilhite-portfolio.pages.dev/#/construction` (or the matching hash).
2. Or evaluate `window.UML.navigate("construction")` / `UML.setMonth("2026-08")` / `UML.state()`.
3. Click `[data-bot="…"]` controls (see `UML.selectors` and `/llms.txt`).
4. For data changes, prefer REST (`GET /api/agent/map` lists endpoints) or the in-app Co-host / Build chats.

Hash routes: `#/overview` `#/report` `#/report/documents` `#/guests` `#/ranch` `#/lindon` `#/river` `#/construction`.

Partner contribution tracking is **construction only**, not rental properties.
